# Qwen3-32B dense, full attention in every layer (no recurrent state, so no checkpoints: a cached prefix is reused
# token by token). Its KV cache costs about 4x the hybrid 27B's per token (64 attention layers against 16: about
# 136 KB a token at q8_0), so the context is the trade: 49152 total (16k a slot) is 6.4 GB of cache beside about
# 19 GB of Q4_K_M weights (27.1 GB in all as loaded); 65536 (21k a slot) is 8.5 GB, about 29 GB in all, and uses
# the card as D26 asks; 98304 would be 12.8 GB and does not fit. The structured roles use ~3k tokens a call; the
# narrator's window is trimmed to the slot. Already on gumbo. Qwen3 (not 3.5): thinking is off via the template kwarg.
MODEL=$HOME/llms/text-generation-webui/user_data/models/Qwen3-32B-abliterated.Q4_K_M.gguf
CTX=65536
CKPT=2048
